{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322218001:1":{"text":"你们是卡列琳娜小姐邀请来帮忙的？太好了，我正为画框保养发愁呢。","source_cn":"你们是卡列琳娜小姐邀请来帮忙的？太好了，我正为画框保养...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D41695326198BC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322218002:1":{"text":"我经常会为子爵先生做一些艺术品的日常保养，可是保养画框的材料没有了，这样下去画框会腐朽。","source_cn":"我经常会为子爵先生做一些艺术品的日常保养，可是保养画框...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BE1BF361A7C605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322218003:1":{"text":"而我不便离开这里，只好麻烦几位了。","source_cn":"而我不便离开这里，只好麻烦几位了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95C74292E10A69A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322218004:1":{"text":"保养需要一些植物油脂——记住，一定要从天然的植物中提取出来，最好再有点自然的香气，子爵先生在这方面是很挑剔的。","source_cn":"保养需要一些植物油脂——记住，一定要从天然的植物中提取...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D09E82D283DDAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:管家瓦茨拉夫":{"text":"管家瓦茨拉夫","source":"管家瓦茨拉夫","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}